Mark: Oh, wait, it's the OTHER platform. Oops.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.200
Sorry.
Bob: Oh, for fuck's sake.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.580
Mark: How do we get over there?
Bob: That's what I get for fucking trusting you!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.740
Mark: I'm sorry, man.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.140
How the fuck do we get over there?

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:02.960
Bob: Do we have to fight through the main fore of this thing, and just go, "Ah!"

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.320
I leaped off, like an idiot.

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.160
What are those yellow things, by the way?

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.300
Mark: Yellow things?
Bob: Are those just guys that don't know where we're at?

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:12.280
Oh, those are totally dudes!
Mark: Yea, those are dudes.
Bob: Those are totally dudes!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.600
Mark: Alright, I'm coming for ya!

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:17.040
Yyyyyiih, don't spot me.
Bob: Oh fuck. Oh geez. Hang on!

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:18.300
Hang on!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.800
I'm gonna try and make it across to these boxes over here.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.800
Mark: I see. That guy's got a-
Bob: *sounds of effort* ...That's not a hiding place!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.940
That's not a hiding place! Okay.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.880
This is a hiding place.
Mark: We're good, man, we're good.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:31.740
Alright, I'm goin' for it.
Bob: There's a guy...

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:35.040
Yeah. Dude, I just wanna try and get the fuck outta here.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.880
Mark: Yeah. I think, over here maybe, there's like...

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.100
Oh yeah, this leads up.
Bob: Ohhh?

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:43.080
So sneaky-peeky!
Mark: Wait.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:47.780
This don't seem right.
Bob: What? Someone just yelled "Murder."
Mark: Murder?

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.160
"They murdered Hitler!" "Whaaaat? I can't believe it!"

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.860
Oooh, oops.
Bob: Oh, someone's going up here. Someone's going up here! Hide, hide, hide, hide!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.700
Mark: No, get out the window! This is the escape!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:58.960
Bob: Oh, okay. Right here, dear?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.900
Mark: N- I well mean, a little farther away from the escape, but yeah, I guess so.
Bob: Whatever.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.640
Mark: Oh! Nevermind.
Bob: Oh wait, whatever. We're both there.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.280
We're the same guy again now.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.120
Mark: Apparently- Ah, maybe I'm leaving you behind.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.240
Okay, well, we killed Hhhhuh- there we go, then, I guess!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.240
Bob: Fuckin' easy-peasy!

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:17.820
Mark: Yea, Hitler wa-
Bob: Killing Hitler was so much easier than the rest of this bullshit!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.200
Mark: Yea! I don't know why that was such a big deal!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.680
Bob: Well, we didn't locate the supplies or sabotaged any failsafes, but...

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.660
Mark: Eh, it's okay!
Bob: Guys, can you give us some credit?

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.720
Fucking... Killed the... leader of the... Axis-

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:32.580
Mark: Well I mean- I think I killed hitler.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:36.100
Bob: Ah, I'm pretty sure you wouldn't have gotten there without me.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.420
Mark: Ah-
Bob: Remember how you had to keep saving my life?

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.340
Mark: Yeah.
Bob: Remember that?

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:43.500
Mark: Ah, maybe.
Bob:  Remember how you're level 6 and I'm level 3? How did that happen?

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.960
Mark: So... you taught me about death...

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.200
... and that's what allowed me to have the will to kill Hitler.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:51.260
Bob: *sniffing*

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.080
Bob: *laughs*

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:55.460
*outro plays*

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.200
(pandas)

